<div class="aboutus-banner">
  <%= image_tag 'page-header-about-us.jpg', class: 'img-fluid' %>
  <div class="caption d-flex justify-content-center flex-column">
    <div class="container-fluid page__container">
      <ul class="list-unstyled p-0 mb-1">
        <li class="d-inline-block"><%= link_to "Home", root_path, class: 'text-white' %></li>
        <li class="d-inline-block mx-1 text-white">></li>
        <li class="d-inline-block"><%= link_to "Services", '#', class: 'text-white' %></li>
      </ul>
      <h1 class="text-white mb-2">About Us</h1>
      <p class="text-white text-light">A hub for E-Learning Organizations!</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="pt-5" style="line-height: 28px;">
  <div class="container-fluid page__heading-container">
    <h3 class="bold text-black text-center mb-5 cd-headline rotate-1">Manage
      <span class="cd-words-wrapper bg-primary text-white">
        <b class="is-visible">E-Learning</b>
        <b>Instructors</b>
        <b>Students</b>
      </span>
      with Educater's Room
    </h3>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
        <h5 class="bold">Our Mission</h5>
        <p class="text-justify">There is a growing need for e-learning solutions in today's age with the growing demand for online learning. Educater's Room's purpose is to cater to this growing demand by providing organizations with a pre-built e-learning platform with all the solutions in one place. Organizations can easily manage their instructors, students, and courses with a system that is specifically built for this task.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
        <h5 class="bold">Our Vision</h5>
        <p class="text-justify">To focus on the features that you need to expand your offerings and increase the engagement of your students. So, with Educater’s Room, you can deliver a more appealing learning experience to your trainees.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <h5 class="bold">Why Us?</h5>
        <p class="text-justify">Educater's Room facilitates organizations by providing a ready-to-use e-learning platform that has all the necessary features required to conduct long-distance learning. We offer a platform with pre-built tools that will aid your organization in creating and managing a remote learning environment for your customers.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


<section class="section bg-primary text-white text-center py-4">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row pb-4 pt-3">
      <div class="col-sm-4 mb-5 mb-lg-0">
        <div class="counter">
          <i class="fas fa-user fa-3x mb-2"></i>
          <strong class="d-block bold" style="font-size: 40px; line-height: 44px;">15+</strong>
          <label class="mt-1">Top Registered Organizations</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-sm-4 mb-5 mb-lg-0">
        <div class="counter">
          <i class="fas fa-business-time fa-3x mb-2"></i>
          <strong class="d-block bold" style="font-size: 40px; line-height: 44px;">10+</strong>
          <label class="mt-1">E-Learning Experience in Years</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-sm-4 mb-5 mb-sm-0">
        <div class="counter">
          <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap fa-3x mb-2"></i>
          <strong class="d-block bold" style="font-size: 40px; line-height: 44px;">200+</strong>
          <label class="mt-1">Experienced & Certified Professionals</label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="four-section">
  <div class="align-items-center">
    <h3 class="bold">Our Origin & Story!</h3>
    <h5>We offer services that the world does not!</h5>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0">
        <div class="p-3 px-5 h-100 aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-right" data-offset="-100">
          <p class="text-justify">There are already too many different existing e-learning platforms so why Educater’s Room? In this era it is very common for students to get online courses but too difficult for any organization to manage a remote learning environment.</p>
          <p class="text-justify">So the main idea of Educater’s Room’s team is to cater all solutions at one place for organizations where they can easily manage their offerings with the help of this distance learning tool.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0 box" style="min-height: 300px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="parallax">
          <%= image_tag("about/our-story.png") %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="align-items-center order-change">
    <h3 class="bold">What we do?</h3>
    <h5>Our core vision is to make Organizations Global!</h5>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0 box" style="min-height: 300px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="parallax">
          <%= image_tag("about/what-we-do.png") %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0">
        <div class="p-3 px-5 h-100 aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-right" data-offset="-100">
          <p class="text-justify">Educater’s Room is a platform where educational institutes, non-profit organizations and any other corporation can build an e-learning platform for their organization with absolutely no coding. We provide you with pre-built tools that will aid your organization in creating and managing a remote learning environment for your customers. Educater’s Room facilitates organizations by providing them all the necessary features required to facilitate long distance learning for their instructors and students.</p>
          <p class="text-justify">It also allows organizations to focus on the instructor’s input and the student’s success by providing effective training accessible from anywhere in the world. Now you can create a classroom environment and deliver self-paced online courses by using Educater’s Room distance learning tool.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="align-items-center">
    <h3 class="bold">Easy to Use!</h3>
    <h5>User experience is what matters Today!</h5>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0">
        <div class="p-3 px-5 h-100 aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-right" data-offset="-100">
          <p class="text-justify">We provide a simple and intuitive user interface which is very easy to use. We help organizations to improve their distance learning experience with a safe, efficient and effective platform where organizations can manage their instructors and students. With the continual increase in the e-learning market, it has never been easier to start your own e-learning platform.</p>
          <p class="text-justify">So what are you waiting for? Join Educater’s Room today and hit the ground running with our distance learning tools and become a market leading e-learning content provider.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0 box" style="min-height: 300px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="parallax">
          <%= image_tag("about/our-story.png") %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="align-items-center order-change">
    <h3 class="bold">We design for you!</h3>
    <h5>Our design focuses to fulfil the real needs of Organizations!</h5>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0 box" style="min-height: 300px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="parallax">
          <%= image_tag("about/what-we-do.png") %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6 p-0">
        <div class="p-3 px-5 h-100 aos-init aos-animate" data-aos="fade-right" data-offset="-100">
          <p class="text-justify">We mainly focus on the design needs of the different Educational Organizations. We just provide the list of features that you need to expand your offerings and increase the engagement of your students.</p>
          <p class="text-justify">With Educater’s Room you can deliver an appealing learning experience to your trainees, a platform for your staff & instructors to manage complete syllabus and what not!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%= render 'shared/public_partials/register' %>
